  "A bold, black-and-white design language built for clarity, efficiency, and confident minimalism. Every element serves a purpose.": "大胆的黑白设计语言，旨在实现清晰、高效和自信的极简主义。每个元素都有一个目的。",
  "A clean, approachable design language that bridges consumer-friendly appeal with technical credibility through white-space-driven layouts and colorful product accents.": "一种简洁、平易近人的设计语言，通过空白驱动的布局和丰富多彩的产品装饰，将消费者友好的吸引力与技术cal可信度联系起来。",
  "A complete visual catalog of design tokens, components, and patterns extracted from Framer's marketing site and documented in DESIGN.md.": "从 Framer 的营销网站提取并记录在 DESIGN.md 中的设计标记、组件和模式的完整可视化目录。",
  "A design token catalog generated from DESIGN.md. Every color, font, and component — bold, green, and borderless.": "从 DESIGN.md 生成的设计令牌目录。每种颜色、字体和组件 — 粗体、绿色和无边框。",
  "A design token catalog generated from DESIGN.md. Every color, font, and component — visualized in the dark.": "从 DESIGN.md 生成的设计令牌目录。每种颜色、字体和组件都在黑暗中可视化。",
  "A design token catalog generated from DESIGN.md. Every color, font, and component — visualized with fintech precision.": "从 DESIGN.md 生成的设计令牌目录。每种颜色、字体和组件均以金融科技精度可视化。",
  "A design token catalog generated from DESIGN.md. Every color, font, and component — visualized with warm craft.": "从 DESIGN.md 生成的设计令牌目录。每一种颜色、字体和组件——都以温暖的工艺可视化。",
  "A design token catalog generated from DESIGN.md. Every color, font, and spacing value — visualized against the void.": "从 DESIGN.md 生成的设计令牌目录。每一种颜色、字体和间距值都在空白处可视化。",
