  "Bento Box Grid is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Modular cards, asymmetric grid, varied sizes, Apple-style, dashboard tiles, negative space, clean hierarchy, cards. The visual direction is shaped by grid-template with varied spans, rounded-xl (16px), subtle shadows, hover scale (1.02), smooth transitions.": "Bento Box Grid 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，结合了模块化卡片、不对称网格、不同尺寸、Apple 样式、仪表板图块、负空间、干净的层次结构、卡片。视觉方向由网格模板塑造，具有不同的跨度、圆角 xl (16px)、微妙的阴影、悬停 scale (1.02)、平滑过渡。",
  "Bento Box Grid is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Modular cards, asymmetric grid, varied sizes, Apple-style, dashboard tiles.": "Bento Box Grid 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注模块化卡片、不对称网格、不同尺寸、Apple 样式、仪表板图块。",
  "Bento box layouts create visual hierarchy through asymmetric grid arrangements. Each \"box\" contains distinct content, making information easy to scan while maintaining aesthetic appeal. This layout style has become popular in modern design for its flexibility and visual interest.": "便当盒布局通过不对称的网格排列创建视觉层次结构。每个“盒子”都包含不同的内容，使信息易于浏览，同时保持美观。这种布局风格因其灵活性和视觉趣味而在现代设计中变得流行。",
  "Bento Grid Layout": "便当网格布局",
  "Bento Grids - UI Style #53": "Bento Grids - UI 样式 #53",
  "BENTO GRIDS >": "BENTO GRIDS >",
  "Bento Grids is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Apple-style, modular, cards, organized, clean, hierarchy, grid, rounded, soft. The visual direction is shaped by Hover scale (1.02), soft shadow expansion, smooth layout shifts, content reveal.": "Bento Grids 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 Apple 风格、模块化、卡片、组织、干净、层次、网格、圆形、柔和。视觉方向由悬停 scale (1.02)、柔和的阴影扩展、平滑的布局转换、内容显示决定。",
  "Bento Grids is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Apple-style, modular, cards, organized, clean.": "Bento Grids 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注 Apple 风格、模块化、卡片、有组织、干净。",
  "Berkeley Mono as the sole typeface -- monospace everywhere, no sans-serif or serif voices": "Berkeley Mono 作为唯一的字体——到处都是等宽字体，没有无衬线或衬线声音",
  "Berkeley Mono is the sole typeface, establishing an unapologetic monospace identity. Every element -- headings, body text, buttons, navigation -- shares this single font family, creating a unified \"everything is code\" philosophy. The heading at 38px bold with 1.50 line-height is generous and readable, while body text at 16px with weight 500 provides a slightly heavier-than-normal reading weight that enhances legibility on screen. The monospace grid naturally enforces alignment and rhythm across the layout.": "Berkeley Mono 是唯一的字体，建立了毫无歉意的等宽字体标识。每个元素（标题、正文、按钮、导航）都共享这个单一字体系列，创建了统一的“一切都是代码”理念。标题为 38 像素粗体，行高为 1.50，内容宽敞且可读，而正文为 16 像素，字重为 500，阅读字重比正常字重稍重，增强了屏幕上的易读性。等宽网格自然地加强了整个布局的对齐和节奏。",
  "berkeleyMono for code and technical labels": "berkeleyMono 用于代码和 technical 标签",
