  "Brutalism is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Raw, unpolished, stark, high contrast, plain text, default fonts, visible borders, asymmetric, anti-design. The visual direction is shaped by No smooth transitions (instant), sharp corners (0px), bold typography (700+), visible grid, large blocks.": "Brutalism 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了原始、未修饰、鲜明、高对比度、纯文本、默认字体、可见边框、不对称、反设计。视觉方向由无平滑过渡（即时）、尖角（0px）、粗体排版（700+）、可见网格、大块塑造。",
  "Brutalism is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Raw, unpolished, stark, high contrast, plain text.": "Brutalism 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注原始、未修饰、鲜明、高对比度、纯文本。",
