  "Cal Sans 20px / 600 / 1.20 / +0.2px": "Cal Sans 20 像素 / 600 / 1.20 / +0.2 像素",
  "Cal Sans 24px / 600 / 1.30": "Cal Sans 24 像素 / 600 / 1.30",
