  "Drill-Down Analytics - UI Style #32": "Drill-Down Analytics - UI 样式#32",
  "Drill-Down Analytics &rarr;": "Drill-Down Analytics →",
  "Drill-Down Analytics is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, combining Hierarchical data exploration, expandable sections, interactive drill-down paths, summary-to-detail flow, context preservation. The visual direction is shaped by Drill-down expand animations, breadcrumb click transitions, smooth detail reveal, level change smooth, data reload animation.": "Drill-Down Analytics 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 样式参考，结合了层次结构cal 数据探索、可扩展部分、交互式深入路径、从摘要到细节的流程、上下文保留。视觉方向由向下钻取展开动画、面包屑单击过渡、平滑细节显示、平滑级别更改、数据重新加载动画塑造。",
  "Drill-Down Analytics is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, focused on Hierarchical data exploration, expandable sections, interactive drill-down paths, summary-to-detail flow, context preservation.": "Drill-Down Analytics 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 样式参考，重点关注层次结构cal 数据探索、可扩展部分、交互式向下钻取路径、从摘要到细节的流程、上下文保存。",
  "Drive": "驱动器",
  "Drive when you want": "当你想开车时",
  "Drop zones": "降落区",
  "Dropdowns, tooltips": "下拉菜单、工具提示",
  "Dual custom typeface: CohereText (display serif) + Unica77 (body sans)": "双自定义字体：Cohere文本（显示衬线）+ Unica77（正文无衬线）",
  "Dual layer deep": "双层深",
  "Dual-font identity: geometric sans-serif (abcDiatype) for content, monospace (JetBrains Mono) for technical credibility": "双字体标识：内容采用几何无衬线 (abcDiatype)，技术cal 可信度采用等宽字体 (JetBrains Mono)",
  "Dual-mode: clean white sections + dramatic dark (#15181e) hero/product areas": "双模式：干净的白色部分 + 戏剧性的黑暗 (#15181e) 英雄/产品区域",
  "Dual-typography system: system-ui for authoritative headings, Inter for precise UI/body text, SFMono for code credibility": "双排版系统：system-ui 用于权威标题，Inter 用于精确的 UI/正文，SFMono 用于代码可信度",
  "Dynamic backgrounds and interactive elements": "动态背景和互动元素",
  "Dynamic Blur": "动态模糊",
  "E-commerce product pages": "电商产品页面",
  "E-Ink / Paper - UI Style #56": "E-Ink / Paper - UI 样式 #56",
  "E-Ink / Paper is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Paper-like, matte, high contrast, texture, reading, calm, slow tech, monochrome. The visual direction is shaped by No motion blur, distinct page turns, grain/noise texture, sharp transitions (no fade).": "E-Ink / Paper 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 Paper-like、哑光、高对比度、纹理、阅读、calm、慢科技、单色。视觉方向由无运动模糊、明显的翻页、颗粒/噪声纹理、锐利的过渡（无褪色）决定。",
  "E-Ink / Paper is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Paper-like, matte, high contrast, texture, reading.": "E-Ink / Paper 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注纸质、哑光、高对比度、纹理、阅读。",
  "E-Ink/Paper &rarr;": "电子墨水/纸张 →",
  "Each scroll brings new discoveries. Content appears progressively, maintaining suspense and engagement throughout the experience.": "每卷轴都会带来新的发现。内容逐渐出现，在整个体验过程中保持悬念和参与感。",
  "Earn rewards by staking your crypto. Flexible and bonded options available.": "通过抵押您的加密货币来赚取奖励。提供灵活和保税的选项。",
