  "elevenlabs.io": "elevenlabs.io",
  "ElevenLabs' website is a study in restrained elegance — a near-white canvas (#ffffff, #f5f5f5) where typography and subtle shadows do all the heavy lifting. The design feels like a premium audio product brochure: clean, spacious, and confident enough to let the content speak (literally, given ElevenLabs makes voice AI). There's an almost Apple-like quality to the whitespace strategy, but warmer — the occasional warm stone tint (#f5f2ef, #777169) prevents the purity from feeling clinical.": "ElevenLabs' 网站是对内敛优雅的研究——近乎白色的画布（#ffffff，#f5f5f5），其中的版式和微妙的阴影完成了所有繁重的工作。该设计感觉就像一本高级音频产品手册：干净、宽敞且有足够的信心让内容说话（从字面上看，鉴于 ElevenLabs 发出声音 AI）。空白策略有一种几乎Apple般的品质，但更温暖——偶尔的暖石色调（#f5f2ef，#777169）防止纯粹的感觉clinical。",
  "Eliminate distractions and concentrate on your work.": "消除干扰，专注于工作。",
