  "Exclusively warm-toned neutrals — every gray has a yellow-brown undertone": "独特的暖色调中性色——每种灰色都有黄棕色底色",
  "Executive Dashboard": "Executive Dashboard",
  "Executive Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, combining High-level KPIs, large key metrics, minimal detail, summary view, trend indicators, at-a-glance insights, executive summary. The visual direction is shaped by KPI value animations (count-up), trend arrow direction animations, metric card hover lift, alert pulse effect.": "Executive Dashboard 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，结合了高级 KPI、大型关键指标、最小细节、摘要视图、趋势指标、概览见解、执行摘要。视觉方向由KPI值动画（向上计数）、趋势箭头方向动画、指标卡悬停升降、警报脉冲效果决定。",
  "Executive Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, focused on High-level KPIs, large key metrics, minimal detail, summary view, trend indicators.": "Executive Dashboard 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，重点关注高级 KPI、大型关键指标、最小细节、摘要视图、趋势指标。",
