  "Feature-Rich Showcase is a UI style reference for landing pages, combining Multiple feature sections, grid layout, benefit cards, visual feature demonstrations, interactive elements, problem-solution pairs. The visual direction is shaped by Card hover effects (lift/scale), icon animations on scroll, feature toggle animations, smooth section transitions.": "Feature-Rich Showcase 是着陆页的 UI 样式参考，结合了多个功能部分、网格布局、福利卡、视觉功能演示、交互元素、问题解决方案对。视觉方向由卡片悬停效果（lift/scale）、滚动图标动画、功能切换动画、平滑部分过渡决定。",
  "Feature-Rich Showcase is a UI style reference for landing pages, focused on Multiple feature sections, grid layout, benefit cards, visual feature demonstrations, interactive elements.": "Feature-Rich Showcase 是着陆页的 UI 样式参考，重点关注多个功能部分、网格布局、福利卡、视觉功能演示、交互元素。",
