  "Financial Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, combining Revenue metrics, profit/loss visualization, budget tracking, financial ratios, portfolio performance, cash flow, audit trail. The visual direction is shaped by Number animations (count-up), trend direction indicators, percentage change animations, profit/loss color transitions.": "Financial Dashboard 是分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，结合了收入指标、损益可视化、预算跟踪、财务比率、投资组合绩效、现金流、审计跟踪。视觉方向由数字动画（向上计数）、趋势方向指示器、百分比变化动画、利润/损失颜色过渡决定。",
  "Financial Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, focused on Revenue metrics, profit/loss visualization, budget tracking, financial ratios, portfolio performance.": "Financial Dashboard 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，重点关注收入指标、损益可视化、预算跟踪、财务比率、投资组合绩效。",
