  "Flat design emphasizes content over decoration.": "扁平化设计强调内容而不是装饰。",
  "Flat Design is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining 2D, minimalist, bold colors, no shadows, clean lines, simple shapes, typography-focused, modern, icon-heavy. The visual direction is shaped by No gradients/shadows, simple hover (color/opacity shift), fast loading, clean transitions (150-200ms ease), minimal icons.": "Flat Design 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 2D、简约、大胆的色彩、无阴影、干净的线条、简单的形状、注重版式、现代、图标较多。视觉方向由无渐变/阴影、简单的悬停（颜色/不透明度变化）、快速加载、干净的过渡（150-200ms 轻松）、最小的图标决定。",
  "Flat Design is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on 2D, minimalist, bold colors, no shadows, clean lines.": "Flat Design 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，专注于 2D、简约、大胆的色彩、无阴影、简洁的线条。",
