  "Framer Blue": "Framer 蓝色",
  "Framer Blue (#0099ff) as the sole accent color — cold, electric, precise": "Framer 蓝色 (#0099ff) 作为唯一的强调色 — 冰冷、电热、精确",
  "Framer Blue glow ring (rgba(0,153,255,0.15) 1px). Card borders, interactive outlines.": "Framer 蓝色发光环 (rgba(0,153,255,0.15) 1px)。卡片边框、交互式轮廓。",
  "Framer brings together the power of a visual canvas with the flexibility of code to create stunning, production-ready websites.": "Framer 带来了 together 视觉画布的强大功能以及代码的灵活性，可创建令人惊叹的、可立即投入生产的网站。",
  "framer.com": "framer.com",
  "Framer's website is a cinematic, tool-obsessed dark canvas that radiates the confidence of a design tool built by designers who worship craft. The entire experience is drenched in pure black — not a warm charcoal or a cozy dark gray, but an absolute void (#000000) that makes every element, every screenshot, every typographic flourish feel like it's floating in deep space. This is a website that treats its own product UI as the hero art, embedding full-fidelity screenshots and interactive demos directly into the narrative flow.": "Framer 的网站是一个电影般的、痴迷于工具的黑色画布，散发着由崇尚工艺的设计师打造的设计工具的自信。整个体验浸透在纯黑色中——不是温暖的木炭或舒适的深灰色，而是绝对的空白（#000000），使每个元素、每个屏幕截图、每个印刷华丽感觉都漂浮在深空中。这是一个将自己的产品 UI 视为英雄艺术的网站，将全保真屏幕截图和交互式演示直接嵌入到叙事流程中。",
  "Framework": "框架",
  "Framework fit: All frameworks 10/10; era: Universal.": "框架适合度：所有框架 10/10；时代：通用。",
