  "HashiCorp provides infrastructure automation to provision, secure, connect, and run any infrastructure for any application.": "HashiCorp 提供基础设施自动化，以便为任何应用程序配置、保护、连接和运行任何基础设施。",
  "hashicorp.com": "hashicorp.com",
  "HashiCorp's website is enterprise infrastructure made tangible — a design system that must communicate the complexity of cloud infrastructure management while remaining approachable. The visual language splits between two modes: a clean white light-mode for informational sections and a dramatic dark-mode (#15181e, #0d0e12) for hero areas and product showcases, creating a day/night duality that mirrors the \"build in light, deploy in dark\" developer workflow.": "HashiCorp 的网站是有形的企业基础设施 — 一个设计系统，必须传达云基础设施管理的复杂性，同时保持平易近人。视觉语言分为两种模式：用于信息部分的干净白色光模式和用于英雄区域和产品展示的戏剧性黑暗模式（#15181e，#0d0e12），创建昼/夜二元性，反映“在光中构建，在黑暗中部署”开发人员工作流程。",
