  "IBM Plex Mono for code and technical content with consistent 0.16px letter-spacing at small sizes": "IBM Plex Mono 用于代码和技术cal 内容，在小尺寸下具有一致的 0.16px 字母间距",
  "IBM Plex Sans at weight 300 (Light) for display — corporate gravitas through typographic restraint": "IBM Plex Sans 重量为 300 (Light) 用于展示 — 通过印刷限制展现企业的庄严",
  "IBM Plex Sans Variable font at bold weights (700/800) for headings with generous 1.50+ line-heights": "IBM Plex Sans Variable 字体采用粗体粗细 (700/800)，适用于行高超过 1.50 的标题",
  "IBM Plex Sans Variable with bold headings and generous body line-heights.": "IBM Plex Sans Variable 具有粗体标题和宽大的正文行高。",
  "ibm.com": "ibm.com",
  "IBM's website is the digital embodiment of enterprise authority built on the Carbon Design System — a design language so methodically structured it reads like an engineering specification rendered as a webpage. The page operates on a stark duality: a bright white (#ffffff) canvas with near-black (#161616) text, punctuated by a single, unwavering accent — IBM Blue 60 (#0f62fe). This isn't playful tech-startup minimalism; it's corporate precision distilled into pixels. Every element exists within Carbon's rigid 2x grid, every color maps to a semantic token, every spacing value snaps to the 8px base unit.": "IBM 的网站是建立在 Carbon 设计系统之上的企业权威的数字化体现，Carbon 设计系统是一种设计语言，其结构cal结构严谨，读起来就像呈现为网页的工程规范。该页面具有鲜明的二元性：明亮的白色 (#ffffff) 画布和近乎黑色 (#161616) 的文本，中间有一个坚定的口音 — IBM Blue 60 (#0f62fe)。这不是开玩笑的科技初创公司的极简主义；而是一种极简主义。它是将企业的精确度提炼成像素。每个元素都存在于 Carbon 严格的 2x 网格中，每种颜色都映射到一个语义标记，每个间距值都与 8px 基本单位对齐。",
  "Icon hover": "图标悬停",
  "Icy blue-tinted borders: rgba(214, 235, 253, 0.19) — every border has a cold, crystalline shimmer": "冰蓝色边框：rgba(214, 235, 253, 0.19) — 每个边框都有冰冷的水晶微光",
