  "IN": "IN",
  "In 2019, we faced a problem that seemed impossible to solve. Our team of three sat in a small garage, surrounded by whiteboards filled with failed attempts. Little did we know that our biggest breakthrough was just around the corner.": "2019年，我们遇到了一个看似无法解决的问题。我们的三人团队坐在一个小车库里，周围都是写满失败尝试的白板。我们几乎不知道我们最大的突破即将到来。",
  "In 30 minutes": "30分钟后",
  "In a world of saturated colors and overwhelming visual noise, there's profound beauty in simplicity. E-ink design strips away everything unnecessary, leaving only the essential: black ink on white paper.": "在色彩饱和、视觉噪音压倒性的世界里，简约中蕴藏着深刻的美。电子墨水设计去掉了所有不必要的东西，只留下了必要的部分：白纸上的黑色墨水。",
  "In Progress": "进行中",
  "In spatial UI, windows float in 3D space. They can be positioned, resized, and arranged around the user for optimal workflow.": "在空间 UI 中，窗口漂浮在 3D 空间中。它们可以围绕用户定位、调整大小和排列，以实现最佳工作流程。",
  "In-text links only": "仅文本链接",
  "Inclusive Design - UI Style #17": "Inclusive Design - UI 样式 #17",
  "Inclusive Design &rarr;": "Inclusive Design →",
  "Inclusive Design is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Accessible, color-blind friendly, high contrast, haptic feedback, voice interaction, screen reader, WCAG AAA, universal. The visual direction is shaped by Haptic feedback (vibration), voice guidance, focus indicators (4px+ ring), motion options, alt content, semantic.": "Inclusive Design 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了无障碍、色盲友好、高对比度、触觉反馈、语音交互、屏幕阅读器、WCAG AAA、通用。视觉方向由触觉反馈（振动）、语音指导、焦点指示器（4px+ 环）、动作选项、替代内容、语义决定。",
  "Inclusive Design is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Accessible, color-blind friendly, high contrast, haptic feedback, voice interaction.": "Inclusive Design 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注无障碍、色盲友好、高对比度、触觉反馈、语音交互。",
