  "Interactive Product Demo is a UI style reference for landing pages, combining Embedded product mockup/video, interactive elements, product walkthrough, step-by-step guides, hover-to-reveal features, embedded demos. The visual direction is shaped by Product animation playback, step progression animations, hover reveal effects, smooth zoom on interaction.": "Interactive Product Demo 是着陆页的 UI 样式参考，结合了嵌入式产品模型/视频、交互元素、产品演练、分步指南、悬停显示功能、嵌入式演示。视觉方向由产品动画播放、步骤进展动画、悬停显示效果、交互平滑缩放决定。",
