  "Kinetic Typography - UI Style #48": "Kinetic Typography - UI 样式#48",
  "Kinetic Typography is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Motion text, animated type, moving letters, dynamic, typing effect, morphing, scroll-triggered text. The visual direction is shaped by @keyframes text animation, typing effect, background-clip: text, GSAP ScrollTrigger, split text.": "Kinetic Typography 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，结合了运动文本、动画类型、移动字母、动态、打字效果、变形、滚动触发文本。视觉方向由@keyframes文本动画、打字效果、背景剪辑：文本、GSAP ScrollTrigger、分割文本决定。",
  "Kinetic Typography is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Motion text, animated type, moving letters, dynamic, typing effect.": "Kinetic Typography 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注运动文本、动画类型、移动字母、动态、打字效果。",
  "Kinetic typography transforms static text into dynamic visual experiences. Movement guides attention, creates rhythm, and evokes emotion.": "动态排版将静态文本转化为动态视觉体验。运动引导注意力、创造节奏并唤起情感。",
