  "Memphis design breaks all the rules. It's anti-minimalist, anti-serious, and unapologetically fun. Perfect for brands that want to stand out.": "孟菲斯的设计打破了所有规则。这是反极简主义、反严肃的，而且毫无歉意cal非常有趣。非常适合想要脱颖而出的品牌。",
  "Memphis Design is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining 80s, geometric, playful, postmodern, shapes, patterns, squiggles, triangles, neon, abstract, bold. The visual direction is shaped by transform: rotate(), clip-path: polygon(), mix-blend-mode, repeating patterns, bold shapes.": "Memphis Design 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 80 年代、几何、俏皮、后现代、形状、图案、曲线、三角形、霓虹灯、抽象、粗体。视觉方向由变换：旋转（）、剪辑路径：多边形（）、混合混合模式、重复图案、粗体形状决定。",
