  "Micro-interactions &rarr;": "Micro-interactions →",
  "Micro-interactions is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Small animations, gesture-based, tactile feedback, subtle animations, contextual interactions, responsive. The visual direction is shaped by Small hover (50-100ms), loading spinners, success/error state anim, gesture-triggered (swipe/pinch), haptic.": "Micro-interactions 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，结合了小动画、基于手势、触觉反馈、微妙动画、上下文交互、响应式。视觉方向由小悬停（50-100 毫秒）、加载旋转器、成功/错误状态动画、手势触发（滑动/捏合）、触觉决定。",
  "Micro-interactions is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Small animations, gesture-based, tactile feedback, subtle animations, contextual interactions.": "Micro-interactions 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注小动画、基于手势、触觉反馈、微妙动画、上下文交互。",
