  "Multi-font system: DM Sans for UI, Outfit for display headings, Poppins for mid-tier, and Roboto for data/technical contexts. Weight 500 as default emphasis.": "多字体系统：DM Sans 用于 UI，Outfit 用于显示标题，Popins 用于中间层，Roboto 用于数据/技术cal 上下文。默认强调权重为 500。",
