  "ollama run llama3.2": "ollama 运行 llama3.2",
  "Ollama's interface is radical minimalism taken to its logical conclusion — a pure-white void where content floats without decoration, shadow, or color. The design philosophy mirrors the product itself: strip away everything unnecessary until only the essential tool remains. This is the digital equivalent of a Dieter Rams object — every pixel earns its place, and the absence of design IS the design.": "Ollama 的界面是 radical 极简主义，其 logical 结论是纯白色的空间，内容漂浮在没有装饰、阴影或颜色的情况下。设计理念反映了产品本身：去掉一切不必要的东西，直到只剩下必要的工具。这相当于迪特·拉姆斯 (Dieter Rams) 对象的数字版本 — 每个像素都赢得了自己的位置，并且缺乏设计 IS 设计。",
  "On": "开",
