  "opencode.ai": "opencode.ai",
  "OpenCode's website embodies a terminal-native, monospace-first aesthetic that reflects its identity as an open source AI coding agent. The entire visual system is built on a stark dark-on-light contrast using a near-black background (#201d1d) with warm off-white text (#fdfcfc). This isn't a generic dark theme -- it's a warm, slightly reddish-brown dark that feels like a sophisticated terminal emulator rather than a cold IDE. The warm undertone in both the darks and lights (notice the subtle red channel in #201d1d -- rgb(32, 29, 29)) creates a cohesive, lived-in quality.": "OpenCode 的网站体现了终端原生、等宽空间优先的美学，反映了其作为开源 AI 编码代理的身份。整个视觉系统建立在鲜明的暗光对比之上，使用近乎黑色的背景（#201d1d）和温暖的灰白色文本（#fdfcfc）。这不是一个通用的深色主题——它是一种温暖的、略带红棕色的深色，感觉像一个复杂的终端模拟器，而不是一个冷的IDE。黑暗和明亮的温暖底色（注意 #201d1d 中微妙的红色通道 -- rgb(32, 29, 29)）创造了一种有凝聚力的、持久的品质。",
