  "Primary palette: Alert colors: critical (red #FF0000), warning (orange #FFA500), normal (green #22C55E), updating (blue animation)": "主要调色板：警报颜色：critical（红色#FF0000）、警告（橙色#FFA500）、正常（绿色#22C55E）、更新（蓝色动画）",
  "Primary palette: Bold colors emphasize movement, high contrast animated, dynamic gradients, accent action colors": "主要调色板：大胆的颜色强调运动、高对比度动画、动态渐变、强调动作颜色",
  "Primary palette: Brand colors, professional palette (blue/grey/white), accent for KPIs, red for alerts/concerns": "主要调色板：品牌颜色、专业调色板（蓝/灰/白）、KPI 强调色、警报/疑虑红色",
