  "Primary palette: Complementary: Blue-Orange, Purple-Yellow, Electric Blue #0080FF, Magenta #FF1493, Cyan #00FFFF": "主要调色板： 补充色：蓝橙色、紫黄色、电蓝色 #0080FF、洋红色 #FF1493、青色 #00FFFF",
  "Primary palette: Deep Black #000000, Dark Grey #121212, Midnight Blue #0A0E27": "主要调色板：深黑#000000、深灰色#121212、午夜蓝#0A0E27",
