  "Primary palette: Gradient scale: Cool (blue #0080FF) to hot (red #FF0000), neutral middle (white/yellow)": "主要调色板：渐变 scale：冷色（蓝色 #0080FF）到热色（红色 #FF0000），中性中间（白色/黄色）",
