  "Primary palette: Light pastels: Soft Blue #C8E0F4, Soft Pink #F5E0E8, Soft Grey #E8E8E8": "主要调色板：浅粉彩：柔和的蓝色#C8E0F4，柔和的粉色#F5E0E8，柔和的灰色#E8E8E8",
  "Primary palette: Monochromatic primary, white background, single accent color for CTA, black/dark grey text": "主调色板：单色主色、白色背景、CTA 单一强调色、黑色/深灰色文本",
  "Primary palette: Monochromatic, Black #000000, White #FFFFFF": "主要调色板：单色、黑色 #000000、白色 #FFFFFF",
