  "Real-Time Monitoring &rarr;": "Real-Time Monitoring →",
  "Real-Time Monitoring is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, combining Live data updates, status indicators, alert notifications, streaming data visualization, active monitoring, streaming charts. The visual direction is shaped by Real-time chart animations, alert pulse/glow, status indicator blink animation, smooth data stream updates, loading effect.": "Real-Time Monitoring 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 样式参考，结合了实时数据更新、状态指示器、警报通知、流数据可视化、主动监控、流图表。视觉方向由实时图表动画、警报脉冲/发光、状态指示器闪烁动画、流畅的数据流更新、加载效果决定。",
  "Real-Time Monitoring is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, focused on Live data updates, status indicators, alert notifications, streaming data visualization, active monitoring.": "Real-Time Monitoring 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 样式参考，重点关注实时数据更新、状态指示器、警报通知、流数据可视化、主动监控。",
