  "replicate.run(\"stability-ai/sdxl\", input={\"prompt\": \"...\"})": "replicate.run(\"stability-ai/sdxl\", input={\"prompt\": \"...\"})",
  "Replicate's interface is a developer playground crackling with creative energy — a bold, high-contrast design that feels more like a music festival poster than a typical API platform. The hero section explodes with a vibrant orange-red-magenta gradient that immediately signals \"this is where AI models come alive,\" while the body of the page grounds itself in a clean white canvas where code snippets and model galleries take center stage.": "Replicate 的界面是一个充满创造力的开发者游乐场——大胆、高对比度的设计，感觉更像是音乐节海报，而不是 typecal API 平台。英雄部分爆发出充满活力的橙红洋红色渐变，立即表明“这就是 AI 模型活跃起来的地方”，而页面主体则位于干净的白色画布中，其中代码片段和模型库占据了中心舞台。",
