  "Responsive": "反应灵敏",
  "Responsive breakpoints with automatic layout adjustments across all devices.": "响应断点，可在所有设备上自动调整布局。",
  "RESTful API with SDKs for all languages": "RESTful API 以及适用于所有语言的 SDK",
  "Restrained and muted — dark pills, frosted tags, underline ghosts.": "克制和沉默——黑色药丸、磨砂标签、下划线幽灵。",
  "Restrained and muted — dark pills, frosted tags, underline ghosts. No bright CTAs.": "克制和沉默——黑色药丸、磨砂标签、下划线幽灵。没有明亮的CTAs。",
  "Restrained CTAs using Warm Cream and Charcoal Ink.": "使用温奶油和木炭墨水抑制CTAs。",
  "Restrained CTAs using Warm Cream and light tones on dark surfaces.": "在深色表面上使用暖奶油色和浅色调进行克制CTAs。",
  "Restrained elevation using borders and color contrast instead of heavy shadows.": "使用边框和颜色对比而不是浓重的阴影来限制高度。",
