  "Runway Black": "跑道黑色",
  "Runway's interface is a cinematic reel brought to life as a website — a dark, editorial, film-production-grade design where full-bleed photography and video ARE the primary UI elements. This is not a typical tech product page; it's a visual manifesto for AI-powered creativity. Every section feels like a frame from a film: dramatic lighting, sweeping landscapes, and intimate human moments captured in high-quality imagery that dominates the viewport.": "Runway 的界面就像一个电影卷轴，以网站的形式呈现出来 — 一种黑暗的、编辑的、电影制作级的设计，其中全出血摄影和视频 ARE 是主要的 UI 元素。这不是典型的cal技术产品页面；这是 AI 驱动的创造力的视觉宣言。每个部分都感觉像是电影中的一个画面：戏剧性的灯光、一览无遗的风景以及在占据视口的高质量图像中捕捉到的亲密的人类时刻。",
