  "Sales Intelligence Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, combining Deal pipeline, sales metrics, territory performance, sales rep leaderboard, win-loss analysis, quota tracking, forecast accuracy. The visual direction is shaped by Deal movement animations, metric updates, leaderboard ranking changes, gauge needle movements, status change highlights.": "Sales Intelligence Dashboard 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，结合了交易渠道、销售指标、区域绩效、销售代表排行榜、盈亏分析、配额跟踪、预测准确性。视觉方向由交易运动动画、指标更新、排行榜排名变化、仪表指针运动、状态变化亮点决定。",
  "Sales Intelligence Dashboard is a UI style reference for analytics and BI dashboards, focused on Deal pipeline, sales metrics, territory performance, sales rep leaderboard, win-loss analysis.": "Sales Intelligence Dashboard 是用于分析和 BI 仪表板的 UI 风格参考，重点关注交易渠道、销售指标、区域绩效、销售代表排行榜、盈亏分析。",
