  "Skeuomorphism &rarr;": "Skeuomorphism →",
  "Skeuomorphism is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Realistic, texture, depth, 3D appearance, real-world metaphors, shadows, gradients, tactile, detailed, material. The visual direction is shaped by Realistic shadows (layers), depth (perspective), texture details (noise, grain), realistic animations (300-500ms).": "Skeuomorphism 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了现实、纹理、深度、3D 外观、现实世界隐喻、阴影、渐变、触觉、细节、材质。视觉方向由逼真的阴影（图层）、深度（透视）、纹理细节（噪声、颗粒）、逼真的动画（300-500 毫秒）决定。",
  "Skeuomorphism is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Realistic, texture, depth, 3D appearance, real-world metaphors.": "Skeuomorphism 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注现实、纹理、深度、3D 外观、现实世界隐喻。",
