  "Soft UI": "软 UI",
  "Soft UI Evolution - UI Style #19": "Soft UI Evolution - UI 样式 #19",
  "Soft UI Evolution &rarr;": "Soft UI Evolution →",
  "Soft UI Evolution is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Evolved soft UI, better contrast, modern aesthetics, subtle depth, accessibility-focused, improved shadows, hybrid. The visual direction is shaped by Improved shadows (softer than flat, clearer than neumorphism), modern (200-300ms), focus visible, WCAG AA/AAA.": "Soft UI Evolution 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了进化软 UI、更好的对比度、现代美学、微妙的深度、注重可访问性、改进的阴影、混合。视觉方向由改进的阴影（比平面更柔和，比拟态更清晰）、现代（200-300ms）、焦点可见、WCAG AA/AAA 塑造。",
  "Soft UI Evolution is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Evolved soft UI, better contrast, modern aesthetics, subtle depth, accessibility-focused.": "Soft UI Evolution 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，专注于进化软 UI、更好的对比度、现代美学、微妙的深度、注重可访问性。",
  "Soft, rounded forms with glossy finishes": "柔软、圆润的形状和光滑的饰面",
  "Software tools": "软件工具",
  "sohne-var with OpenType \"ss01\" on all text -- a custom stylistic set that defines the brand's letterforms": "sohne-var 的所有文本均带有 OpenType“ss01”——定义品牌字母形式的自定义风格集",
  "Solid offset shadows. No blur, no gradient. Pure geometric shadows.": "固体偏移阴影。没有模糊，没有渐变。纯几何阴影。",
  "Source Code Pro for uppercase technical labels (1.2px letter-spacing)": "用于大写 technical 标签的 Source Code Pro（1.2px 字母间距）",
