  "Spatial UI (VisionOS) is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Glass, depth, immersion, spatial, translucent, gaze, gesture, apple, vision-pro. The visual direction is shaped by Parallax depth, dynamic lighting response, gaze-hover effects, smooth scale on focus.": "Spatial UI (VisionOS) 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 Glass、深度、沉浸、空间、半透明、凝视、手势、apple、vision-pro。视觉方向由视差深度、动态光照响应、凝视悬停效果、焦点上的平滑 scale 决定。",
  "Spatial UI (VisionOS) is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Glass, depth, immersion, spatial, translucent.": "Spatial UI (VisionOS) 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注玻璃、深度、沉浸、空间、半透明。",
