  "Spotify Green (#1ed760) as singular brand accent — never decorative, always functional": "Spotify 绿色 (#1ed760) 作为独特的品牌口音 — 从不装饰，始终实用",
  "spotify.com": "spotify.com",
  "Spotify's web interface is a dark, immersive music player that wraps listeners in a near-black cocoon (#121212, #181818, #1f1f1f) where album art and content become the primary source of color. The design philosophy is \"content-first darkness\" — the UI recedes into shadow so that music, podcasts, and playlists can glow. Every surface is a shade of charcoal, creating a theater-like environment where the only true color comes from the iconic Spotify Green (#1ed760) and the album artwork itself.": "Spotify 的网络界面是一个黑暗的、身临其境的音乐播放器，它将听众包裹在一个近乎黑色的茧中（#121212、#181818、#1f1f1f），其中专辑封面和内容成为颜色的主要来源。设计理念是“内容优先的黑暗”——UI 隐入阴影，以便音乐、播客和播放列表能够发光。每个表面都是木炭色，营造出剧院般的环境，唯一真实的颜色来自标志性的 Spotify 绿色 (#1ed760) 和专辑插图本身。",
  "SpotifyMixUI/CircularSp font family with global script support": "SpotifyMixUI/CircularSp 字体系列，支持全局脚本",
  "Spreadsheet-database hybrid. Colorful, friendly, structured data aesthetic": "电子表格-数据库混合体。丰富多彩、友好、结构化的数据美感",
  "Sprint Cycles": "冲刺周期",
