  "Standard body text for general content and descriptions across the interface.": "整个界面的一般内容和描述的标准正文文本。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and button labels. Inter provides geometric precision at every weight.": "段落、导航链接和按钮标签的标准正文文本。 Inter 提供每个重量的几何精度。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and button labels. The default reading weight for all UI copy.": "段落、导航链接和按钮标签的标准正文文本。所有 UI 副本的默认阅读粗细。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and button labels. Tight line-height creates dense, information-rich layouts.": "段落、导航链接和按钮标签的标准正文文本。紧凑的行高创建了密集、信息丰富的布局。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and button labels. Unica77 at its most common size, weight 400.": "段落、导航链接和按钮标签的标准正文文本。 Unica77 最常见的尺寸，重量 400。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and button labels. Weight 400 for reading, 600-700 for UI elements.": "段落、导航链接和按钮标签的标准正文文本。阅读权重为 400，UI 元素权重为 600-700。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation links, and general content. Weight 400 only.": "段落、导航链接和一般内容的标准正文文本。重量仅400。",
  "Standard body text for paragraphs, navigation, and button labels. The workhorse of the type system.": "段落、导航和按钮标签的标准正文文本。类型系统的主力。",
  "Standard body text for UI copy, navigation, and button labels. Anthropic Sans handles all functional text with quiet efficiency.": "UI 复制、导航和按钮标签的标准正文文本。 Anthropic Sans 可以安静高效地处理所有功能文本。",
