  "Standard content card on cream background with sharp architectural corners. Containers defined by background color, not borders. The warm void breathes naturally.": "奶油色背景上的标准内容卡，带有尖锐的建筑角。由背景颜色而不是边框定义的容器。温暖的虚空自然地呼吸着。",
  "Standard content card on dark surface with sharp architectural corners. Containers defined by background color shifts rather than borders.": "深色表面上的标准内容卡，带有尖锐的建筑角。由背景颜色变化而不是边框定义的容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px Border Lavender border and 8px radius. White surface clearly lifted from Cloud Gray page background.": "标准内容卡，边框为 1 像素淡紫色边框，半径为 8 像素。白色表面明显从云灰色页面背景中升起。",
  "Standard content card with 1px Dark Slate border and 8px radius. Widget Dark surface on Banner Dark background.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素深色板岩边框和 8 像素半径。横幅深色背景上的小部件深色表面。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid Border Cream and 8px radius. The default container for features and content sections on Ivory surface.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心边框奶油色和 8 像素半径。 Ivory 表面上功能和内容部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid border-dark and 8px radius. The default container for research articles and feature sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心深色边框和 8 像素半径。研究文章和专题部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid charcoal border at 80% opacity and 8px radius. The default container for features, stats, and content on the dark canvas.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心木炭边框，不透明度为 80%，半径为 8 像素。深色画布上的功能、统计数据和内容的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid charcoal border at 80% opacity and 8px radius. The default container for features, stats, and content sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心木炭边框，不透明度为 80%，半径为 8 像素。功能、统计数据和内容部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid cool-silver border and 8px radius. The default container for research articles and feature sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心冷银色边框和 8 像素半径。研究文章和专题部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid Dark Surface border and 12px radius. The default container on the dark Near Black canvas.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心深色表面边框和 12 像素半径。深色近黑色画布上的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid Light Gray border and 12px radius. The only container style in Ollama. Zero shadows.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素浅灰色实心边框和 12 像素半径。 Ollama 中唯一的容器样式。零阴影。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid Mid Gray border and 12px radius. The only container style in Ollama. Zero shadows.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心中灰色边框和 12 像素半径。 Ollama 中唯一的容器样式。零阴影。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid warm-charcoal border and 8px radius. The default container for features, code blocks, and content sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心暖木炭边框和 8 像素半径。功能、代码块和内容部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px warm-charcoal border and 8px radius. The default container for features and code blocks.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素暖木炭边框和 8 像素半径。功能和代码块的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with subtle border and 8px radius. The default container for features and content sections on the white gallery surface.": "标准内容卡，具有微妙的边框和 8 像素半径。白色图库表面上功能和内容部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with subtle white border at 10% opacity and 4px radius. The default container for most content blocks.": "标准内容卡，带有微妙的白色边框，不透明度为 10%，半径为 4 像素。大多数内容块的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with subtle white border at 8% opacity on pure black surface. Deeper darkness for the dark mode variant.": "标准内容卡，纯黑色表面上带有微妙的白色边框，不透明度为 8%。黑暗模式变体的黑暗程度更深。",
  "Standard content card with subtle white-alpha border and 8px radius. The default container on the black surface.": "标准内容卡，带有微妙的白色 Alpha 边框和 8 像素半径。黑色表面上的默认容器。",
