  "Storytelling-Driven - UI Style #27": "Storytelling-Driven - UI 样式 #27",
  "Storytelling-Driven is a UI style reference for landing pages, combining Narrative flow, visual story progression, section transitions, consistent character/brand voice, emotional messaging, journey visualization. The visual direction is shaped by Section-to-section animations, scroll-triggered reveals, character/icon animations, morphing transitions, parallax narrative.": "Storytelling-Driven 是着陆页的 UI 风格参考，结合了叙事流程、视觉故事进展、章节过渡、一致的角色/品牌声音、情感信息、旅程可视化。视觉方向由分段动画、滚动触发显示、角色/图标动画、变形过渡、视差叙述决定。",
  "Storytelling-Driven is a UI style reference for landing pages, focused on Narrative flow, visual story progression, section transitions, consistent character/brand voice, emotional messaging.": "Storytelling-Driven 是着陆页的 UI 风格参考，重点关注叙事流程、视觉故事进展、章节过渡、一致的角色/品牌声音、情感信息。",
  "Strategic planning": "战略规划",
  "Strategy": "策略",
  "Streamline business processes with automated workflows.": "通过自动化工作流程简化业务流程。",
  "Strict grid systems": "严格的网格系统",
  "Strictly black-and-white interface chrome — color exists only in product content": "严格的黑白界面镀铬——颜色仅存在于产品内容中",
  "Strictly monochromatic: pure black headlines, cool blue-gray body text, no decorative color": "严格单色：纯黑色标题，酷蓝灰色正文，无装饰色",
  "Stripe Purple": "Stripe 紫色",
  "stripe.com": "stripe.com",
  "Stripe's website is the gold standard of fintech design -- a system that manages to feel simultaneously technical and luxurious, precise and warm. The page opens on a clean white canvas (#ffffff) with deep navy headings (#061b31) and a signature purple (#533afd) that functions as both brand anchor and interactive accent. This isn't the cold, clinical purple of enterprise software; it's a rich, saturated violet that reads as confident and premium. The overall impression is of a financial institution redesigned by a world-class type foundry.": "Stripe 的网站是金融科技设计的黄金标准——一个能够同时让人感受到科技cal 和奢华、精确和温暖的系统。该页面在干净的白色画布（#ffffff）上打开，带有深海军蓝标题（#061b31）和标志性紫色（#533afd），既充当品牌锚又充当互动口音。这不是冷酷的、临床cal紫色的企业软件；这是一种浓郁、饱和的紫罗兰色，读起来充满自信和优质。总体印象是由世界一流的铸造厂重新设计的金融机构。",
  "Strong borders": "坚固的边界",
  "Strong emphasis for important content": "强烈强调重要内容",
  "Strong outline + lift": "强悍轮廓+提升",
  "Strong secondary": "强二级",
  "Stronger shadow": "更强的阴影",
  "Structure": "结构",
  "Structured content as data": "结构化内容作为数据",
  "Structured content meets precise design. A dark-first, engineering-grade design language built on achromatic neutrals, tight typography, and vivid accent punctuation.": "结构化内容符合精确设计。一种以黑暗为先的工程级设计语言，建立在消色差中性色、紧凑的版式和生动的口音标点符号之上。",
