  "Supabase Green": "Supabase 绿色",
  "Supabase's website is a dark-mode-native developer platform that channels the aesthetic of a premium code editor — deep black backgrounds (#0f0f0f, #171717) with emerald green accents (#3ecf8e, #00c573) that reference the brand's open-source, PostgreSQL-green identity. The design system feels like it was born in a terminal window and evolved into a sophisticated marketing surface without losing its developer soul.": "Supabase 的网站是一个暗模式原生开发者平台，传达了高级代码编辑器的美感 — 深黑色背景（#0f0f0f、#171717）搭配翠绿色调（#3ecf8e、#00c573），引用了该品牌的开源 PostgreSQL-绿色标识。该设计系统感觉就像是在终端窗口中诞生并演变成复杂的营销界面，但又不失其开发者灵魂。",
  "Super Sans VF variable font with non-standard weight stops (460, 540, 600, 700) — sits between conventional weight categories": "Super Sans VF 可变字体，具有非标准粗细停止点 (460, 540, 600, 700) — 位于传统粗细类别之间",
  "Super Sans VF with non-standard weight stops (460, 540, 600, 700).": "Super Sans VF 具有非标准重量停止点（460、540、600、700）。",
  "Supercharged for pros. The most powerful MacBook ever with the M-series chip delivers unprecedented performance.": "为专业人士提供超强动力。有史以来最强大的 MacBook，配备 M 系列芯片，可提供前所未有的性能。",
  "Supercharged productivity": "生产力大幅提升",
  "SUPERHOST": "SUPERHOST",
  "Superhuman's website feels like opening a luxury envelope — predominantly white, immaculately clean, with a single dramatic gesture of color that commands attention. The hero section is a cinematic purple gradient, a deep twilight wash of #1b1938 that evokes the moment just before dawn, overlaid with confident white typography. Below this dramatic entrance, the rest of the site is almost entirely white canvas with dark charcoal text, creating a stark but refined reading experience.": "Superhuman 的网站感觉就像打开一个豪华信封 - 主要是白色，一尘不染，具有引人注目的单一色彩姿态。英雄部分是电影般的紫色渐变，#1b1938 的深暮光水洗让人想起黎明前的那一刻，上面覆盖着自信的白色字体。在这个引人注目的入口下方，网站的其余部分几乎完全是白色画布，带有深色木炭文本，创造了一种鲜明但精致的阅读体验。",
