  "Swiss Modernism 2.0 - UI Style #50": "Swiss Modernism 2.0 - UI 样式 #50",
  "Swiss Modernism 2.0 &rarr;": "Swiss Modernism 2.0 →",
  "Swiss Modernism 2.0 is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Grid system, Helvetica, modular, asymmetric, international style, rational, clean, mathematical spacing. The visual direction is shaped by display: grid, grid-template-columns: repeat(12 1fr), gap: 1rem, mathematical ratios, clear hierarchy.": "Swiss Modernism 2.0 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了网格系统、Helvetica、模块化、不对称、国际风格、理性、干净、数学cal 间距。视觉方向由显示决定：网格、网格模板列：重复（12 1fr）、间隙：1rem、mathematical 比率、清晰的层次结构。",
  "Swiss Modernism 2.0 is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Grid system, Helvetica, modular, asymmetric, international style.": "Swiss Modernism 2.0 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注网格系统、Helvetica、模块化、不对称、国际风格。",
