  "Use code-first schemas to define documents, objects, and fields with full TypeScript support and validation rules.": "使用代码优先架构来定义具有完整 TypeScript 支持和验证规则的文档、对象和字段。",
  "Use code-first schemas to define documents, objects, and fields with full TypeScript support.": "使用代码优先架构来定义具有完整 TypeScript 支持的文档、对象和字段。",
  "Use it for AI products (產品), chatbots, voice assistants, copilots, AI-powered tools (工具), conversational interfaces. Avoid it for Traditional forms, data-heavy dashboards (儀表板), print-first content.": "将其用于 AI 产品 (Product)、聊天机器人、语音助手、副驾驶、AI 支持的工具 (工具)、对话界面。对于传统表单、数据密集的仪表板（仪表板）、打印优先的内容，请避免使用它。",
