  "Vaporwave emerged from the internet, combining 80s corporate aesthetics, Japanese culture, early web design, and smooth jazz into a surreal critique of consumer capitalism.": "Vaporwave 诞生于互联网，将 80 年代的企业美学、日本文化、早期网页设计和流畅的爵士乐结合在一起，对消费资本主义进行了超现实的批判。",
  "Vaporwave is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Synthwave, retro-futuristic, 80s-90s, neon, glitch, nostalgic, sunset gradient, dreamy, aesthetic. The visual direction is shaped by text-shadow glow, linear-gradient, filter: hue-rotate(), glitch animations, retro scan lines.": "Vaporwave 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了 Synthwave、复古未来、80-90 年代、霓虹灯、故障、怀旧、日落渐变、梦幻、美学。视觉方向由文本阴影发光、linear-渐变、滤镜：hue-rotate()、毛刺动画、复古扫描线塑造。",
  "Vaporwave is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Synthwave, retro-futuristic, 80s-90s, neon, glitch.": "Vaporwave 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，重点关注 Synthwave、复古未来、80-90 年代、霓虹灯、故障。",
