  "vercel.com": "vercel.com",
  "Vercel's website is the visual thesis of developer infrastructure made invisible — a design system so restrained it borders on philosophical. The page is overwhelmingly white (#ffffff) with near-black (#171717) text, creating a gallery-like emptiness where every element earns its pixel. This isn't minimalism as decoration; it's minimalism as engineering principle. The Geist design system treats the interface like a compiler treats code — every unnecessary token is stripped away until only structure remains.": "Vercel 的网站是开发者基础设施变得不可见的视觉主题——一个如此克制的设计系统，它接近哲学cal。该页面绝大多数是白色（#ffffff），带有近乎黑色（#171717）的文本，创建了一个类似画廊的空虚，其中每个元素都获得了自己的像素。这不是极简主义的装饰；而是极简主义。这是以极简主义为工程原则。 Geist 设计系统对待接口就像编译器对待代码一样 — 每个不必要的标记都被剥离，直到只剩下结构。",
  "Verified by 10,000+ enterprises": "10000+企业验证",
