  "Vibrant & Block-based is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Bold, energetic, playful, block layout, geometric shapes, high color contrast, duotone, modern, energetic. The visual direction is shaped by Large sections (48px+ gaps), animated patterns, bold hover (color shift), scroll-snap, large type (32px+), 200-300ms.": "Vibrant & Block-based 是一般界面的 UI 风格参考，结合了大胆、活力、俏皮、块布局、几何形状、高色彩对比度、双色调、现代、活力。视觉方向由大部分（48px+间隙）、动画图案、粗体悬停（颜色偏移）、滚动捕捉、大字体（32px+）、200-300ms决定。",
  "Vibrant & Block-based is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Bold, energetic, playful, block layout, geometric shapes.": "Vibrant & Block-based 是通用界面的 UI 风格参考，侧重于大胆、活力、俏皮、块布局、几何形状。",
