  "warp.dev": "warp.dev",
  "Warp's website feels like sitting at a campfire in a deep forest — warm, dark, and alive with quiet confidence. Unlike the cold, blue-tinted blacks favored by most developer tools, Warp wraps everything in a warm near-black that feels like charred wood or dark earth. The text isn't pure white either — it's Warm Parchment (#faf9f6), a barely-perceptible cream that softens every headline and makes the dark canvas feel inviting rather than austere.": "Warp 的网站感觉就像坐在森林深处的篝火旁 — 温暖、黑暗，充满活力，充满安静的自信。与大多数开发工具青睐的冷蓝色黑色不同，Warp 将所有内容包裹在温暖的近乎黑色中，感觉就像烧焦的木头或深色的泥土。文字也不是纯白色的——它是温暖的羊皮纸 (#faf9f6)，一种几乎难以察觉的奶油色，它软化了每个标题，让深色画布感觉诱人而不是朴素。",
