  "Wise's website is a bold, confident fintech platform that communicates \"money without borders\" through massive typography and a distinctive lime-green accent. The design operates on a warm off-white canvas with near-black text (#0e0f0c) and a signature Wise Green (#9fe870) — a fresh, lime-bright color that feels alive and optimistic, unlike the corporate blues of traditional banking.": "Wise 的网站是一个大胆、自信的金融科技平台，通过大量的排版和独特的柠檬绿口音传达“金钱无国界”的理念。该设计在温暖的灰白色画布上运行，带有近乎黑色的文本 (#0e0f0c) 和标志性的 Wise 绿色 (#9fe870) — 一种清新、明亮的颜色，给人一种充满活力和乐观的感觉，与传统银行业的企业蓝色不同。",
