  "Zero Interface is a UI style reference for general interfaces, combining Minimal visible UI, voice-first, gesture-based, AI-driven, invisible controls, predictive, context-aware, ambient. The visual direction is shaped by Voice recognition UI, gesture detection, AI predictions (smooth reveal), progressive disclosure, smart suggestions.": "Zero Interface 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，结合了最小可见 UI、语音优先、基于手势、AI 驱动、隐形控件、预测、上下文感知、环境。视觉方向由语音识别 UI、手势检测、AI 预测（平滑显示）、渐进式披露、智能建议决定。",
  "Zero Interface is a UI style reference for general interfaces, focused on Minimal visible UI, voice-first, gesture-based, AI-driven, invisible controls.": "Zero Interface 是通用界面的 UI 样式参考，重点关注最小可见 UI、语音优先、基于手势、AI 驱动、不可见控件。",
